      "description": "Assign Medical Subject Headings (MeSH) to a work as a DRAFT for a person to review, in the four stages of skill-pipeline-subject-indexing: over-generate concepts, filter them by NLM's own rules, validate every heading against NLM's MeSH authority with Tool `mesh-authority`, and write the reviewed list. Never emits a heading the authority does not hold.",
